---
config:
  theme: neo
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant AM as Augmentation Manager
    participant AFH as Augmentation Function Handler
    participant EB as Event Bus
    participant DT as Digital Twin
    participant DTM as Digital Twin Model

    %% Phase 1: Developer registers first Augmentation Function (DT not yet started)
    Dev->>AM: getAugmentationFunctionHandler(handlerId)
    AM-->>Dev: AugmentationFunctionHandler

    Dev->>AFH: registerAugmentationFunction(AugmentationFunction1)
    AFH->>EB: publish(RegistrationEvent1)
    Note over EB: No subscribers — event is ignored

    %% Phase 2: Developer starts the Digital Twin
    Dev->>DT: start (through the DigitalTwinEngine)
    DT->>DTM: start()
    DTM->>EB: subscribe(RegistrationEvent, UnregistrationEvent)

    DTM->>AM: getAllAugmentationFunctionHandlers()
    AM-->>DTM: [AugmentationFunctionHandler]

    DTM->>AFH: getAllAugmentationFunctions()
    AFH-->>DTM: [AugmentationFunction1]
    DTM->>DTM: onAugmentationFunctionListAvailable(handlerId, list)

    %% Phase 3: Developer registers a second Augmentation Function
    Note over Dev, DTM: Some time passes...

    Dev->>AFH: registerAugmentationFunction(AugmentationFunction2)
    AFH->>EB: publish(RegistrationEvent2)
    EB-->>DTM: notify(RegistrationEvent2)
    Note over DTM: onAugmentationNewFunctionAvailable(...)

    %% Phase 4: Developer unregisters the Augmentation Function
    Note over Dev, DTM: Some time passes...

    Dev->>AFH: unRegisterAugmentationFunction(AugmentationFunction2 id)
    AFH->>EB: publish(UnRegistrationEvent2)
    EB-->>DTM: notify(UnRegistrationEvent2)
    Note over DTM: onAugmentationFunctionUnAvailable(...)
